{
  "stack": "node24",
  "command": "node server.js",
  "memory": 256,
  "catalyst_auth": true
}

catalyst_auth: true is needed so the incoming request context can carry
authenticated Catalyst user context to AppSail for getCurrentUser(). This
follows Catalyst’s guidance to initialize the SDK with the incoming request and
run operations in the requesting user’s context. (docs.catalyst.zoho.com
[https://docs.catalyst.zoho.com/en/sdk/nodejs/v2/serverless/appsail/implement-catalyst-sdk/?utm_source=openai])
